on exitFrame
  [  0] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [  3] pusharglist 1 ........................... <1>
  [  5] extcall 58 .............................. <soundBusy(1)>
  [  8] not ..................................... <not soundBusy(1)>
  [  9] jmpifz [ 21] ............................ if not soundBusy(1) then
  [ 12] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 13] pusharglist 1 ........................... <0>
  [ 15] extcall 2 ............................... <marker(0)>
  [ 17] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <marker(0)>
  [ 19] extcall 3 ............................... go(marker(0))
